sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Upstream as Upstream App Container<br/>configurable port

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 1: Authenticated Request Proxying

    Client->>Proxy: HTTPS/8443 Request<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / OIDC JWT / X.509 cert
    activate Proxy

    alt Bearer Token Authentication
        Proxy->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/authentication.k8s.io/v1/tokenreviews<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token (in-cluster)
        K8sAPI-->>Proxy: TokenReview result<br/>(user identity, groups)
    else OIDC JWT Authentication
        Note over Proxy: Validate JWT against cached JWKS<br/>(fetched from OIDC Issuer at startup)
    else X.509 Client Certificate
        Note over Proxy: Verify client cert against --client-ca-file<br/>(DynamicFileCAContent, hot-reloaded)
    end

    Proxy->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/authorization.k8s.io/v1/subjectaccessreviews<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token (in-cluster)<br/>Body: {user, resource, verb, namespace}
    K8sAPI-->>Proxy: SubjectAccessReview result<br/>(allowed: true/false)

    alt Authorized
        Proxy->>Upstream: Forward request (HTTP/HTTPS/h2c)<br/>Headers: X-Forwarded-User, X-Forwarded-Groups<br/>(if --auth-header-fields-enabled)
        Upstream-->>Proxy: Response
        Proxy-->>Client: HTTPS Response
    else Denied
        Proxy-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
    end

    deactivate Proxy

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 2: Prometheus Metrics Scraping

    participant Prom as prometheus-k8s<br/>(openshift-monitoring)

    Prom->>Proxy: GET /metrics HTTPS/8443<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (prometheus-k8s SA)
    activate Proxy

    Note over Proxy: Hardcoded Metrics Authorizer:<br/>system:serviceaccount:openshift-monitoring:prometheus-k8s<br/>→ unconditional allow for GET /metrics<br/>(no SubjectAccessReview needed)

    Proxy->>Upstream: GET /metrics<br/>(forwarded without auth)
    Upstream-->>Proxy: Metrics response (text/plain)
    Proxy-->>Prom: HTTPS Metrics response

    deactivate Proxy
